{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-quantum-su2","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:quantum-su2","kind":"definition","title":"Quantum group $\\mathcal{U}_q(\\mathfrak{su}(2))$","tags":["quantum-group","hopf-algebra","su2"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.QuantumSu2","text":"quantum-su2.md","leanSource":"quantum-su2.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:quantum-su2\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q\\in\\mathbb{C}^{*}</code> with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0&#x3C;\\lvert q\\rvert\\le 1</code>. The <strong>quantum group</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{U}_q(\\mathfrak{su}(2))</code> is the associative <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}</code>-algebra generated by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">E,F,K,K^{-1}</code> subject to:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">\\begin{align}\n  KK^{-1}&#x26;=K^{-1}K=1,\n    \\\\[3pt]\n  KEK^{-1}&#x26;=q^2E,\\quad KFK^{-1}=q^{-2}F,\n    \\\\[3pt]\n  [E,F]&#x26;=\\frac{K-K^{-1}}{q-q^{-1}}.\n    \n\\end{align}</code></pre>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/quantum-su2.md","heading":"Definition","number":"7.9.2","page":"b/def-quantum-su2","qa":{"counts":{"pass":83,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":8,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.QuantumSu2","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/quantum-su2.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
